{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2022-10-25 13:15:00', 'title': 'ONSEMI AND RIDE VISION COLLABORATE TO OFFER ADVANCED SAFETY SOLUTIONS FOR MOTORCYCLISTS', 'text': 'PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ONSEMI (NASDAQ: ON), A LEADER IN INTELLIGENT POWER AND SENSING TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS COLLABORATION WITH ISRAEL-BASED RIDE VISION ON THE DEVELOPMENT OF ADVANCED SAFETY SOLUTIONS FOR MOTORCYCLISTS.'}